{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261015/photo/bkn-20261015140122738-1015_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261015141315\"/><p>貓咪被困冷氣機頂。</p><p>消防處昨日（14日）接獲市民求助，指有一隻貓咪被困於北角一幢大廈窗外。消防員接報後迅速趕到現場，展開救援行動。消人員發現貓咪身處外牆冷氣機頂，期間四處張望，情況危險。幸貓咪最終安全獲救，經檢查後確認貓咪並無受傷，交回飼主，人貓團聚。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:34.705982+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T06:01:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:18:02.827475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:55.015775+00:00","content_hash":"0ae99dfab3baf4e3889e51e841d2116563e6b01c0ce68f27decacdeb4a016858","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}